{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object seen, then move, grab it, then inspect/transfer it depending on its weight. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObj    /> <Action ID = GrabObj    /> <Action ID = MoveObjToLocation    /> <Action ID = InspectObj    /> <Condition ID = IsObjVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjLight    />\"",
